# Pilfer: "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. That player discards that card." Unlike Duress it may take a creature card. Bot2 holds
# Lightning Bolt, Guerrilla Gorilla (a creature) and Islands: the Island is refused as a choice (the refusal), the Gorilla is taken (the control), and
# Bot2 discards only it (Bolt and the Islands stay).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Pilfer
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pilfer.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Island)
Bot1.Choose(Guerrilla Gorilla)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Pilfer
Bot2.Graveyard = Guerrilla Gorilla
Bot2.Hand.Count = 6
